# The repo-root .gitignore ignores *.pem/*.der/*.crt for key hygiene. The files below are PUBLIC
# freeTSA RFC 3161 test-vector certificates (a public CA root + its public TSA signing cert) — NOT
# secrets — and are required committed test fixtures for the P4 offline verifier. Re-include exactly
# these. See README.md for provenance.
!freetsa_cacert.pem
!freetsa_cacert.der
!freetsa_tsa_leaf.crt
!freetsa_tsa_leaf.der
